        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cur_gateway" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F0F9FF;strokeColor=#38BDF8;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fontSize=13" value="编排层&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• `backend/data_service` 已成统一入口&lt;br&gt;• ingest / query / summary / page / graph / reset&lt;br&gt;• quality feedback submit/list 已接通&lt;br&gt;• workspace layout 已固定&lt;br&gt;• 用户只需单次写入数据" vertex="1">
